Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.23,0:00:11.93,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Sensei, it's time for class.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.46,0:00:13.95,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yasuda-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.11,0:00:17.17,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Don't say I didn't try to wake you up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.17,0:00:19.65,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,Uh-oh, we should get back to the classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.65,0:00:20.87,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,The bell's about to ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.87,0:00:23.08,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,Whoa. Yasuda's asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:28.27,Main,Female Student A,0,0,0,,His hair is so soft!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.27,0:00:29.76,Main,Female Student B,0,0,0,,This'll look great.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.19,0:00:33.94,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yasuda-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.94,0:00:35.92,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yasuda-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.92,0:00:38.44,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Was there someone behind me just now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:41.59,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Yup, just a couple of third-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.59,0:00:43.43,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I bet they were girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.43,0:00:45.29,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,How could I miss my chance like that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.94,0:00:46.75,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,You know...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.75,0:00:49.96,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Damn, my class is already starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.96,0:00:51.57,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,You know, Yasuda-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.57,0:00:52.99,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What is it?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.09,0:00:57.80,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,There's something wrong with your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.32,0:00:59.94,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.55,0:01:05.33,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why bring it up now?! I'm in a hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.33,0:01:08.19,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I won't argue, but that's not what I meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.19,0:01:09.96,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I'm going to class!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.26,0:02:44.76,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1270,530)\fnArial\b1\fay.01\bord0\fs16\shad1\c&HF3CE89&\3c&H514946&\4c&H3C342D&\pos(141.272,196.364)}Teacher
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.07,0:02:44.76,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Your average on the last exams \Nwas lower than the other classes'.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.52,0:02:48.77,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Write down an answer even if you're unsure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.77,0:02:52.77,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You left way too many questions blank. \NYou're throwing points away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.22,0:02:54.86,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Are you taking this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.12,0:02:58.26,Main - Italics,_All,0,0,0,,Are {\i0}you{\i1} taking this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.46,0:03:01.61,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Yasuda, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.61,0:03:02.28,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.30,0:03:05.23,Main - Italics,Male Student A,0,0,0,,Do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.23,0:03:06.66,Main - Italics,Female Student C,0,0,0,,Ask him, Hori-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.46,0:03:13.92,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Never mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.07,0:03:17.92,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Your English score was good, as usual.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.92,0:03:21.12,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Oh, um... Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.12,0:03:22.44,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,What do I say?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.44,0:03:24.43,Main - Italics,Hori,0,0,0,,I can't think of anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.48,0:03:26.99,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Does that bother you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.99,0:03:27.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:30.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:33.31,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What is it? Need to use the restroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.31,0:03:35.10,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Um, no...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.50,0:03:37.09,Main - Italics,Male Student B,0,0,0,,Ask him, Miyamura!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.09,0:03:38.94,Main - Italics,Female Student D,0,0,0,,You can do it, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.78,0:03:42.20,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The theme...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.20,0:03:44.29,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Th-The theme?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.29,0:03:46.64,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,The theme for today...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.64,0:03:48.41,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.81,0:03:54.21,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Does that have anything\Nto do with what we're discussing?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.21,0:03:56.67,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Er, no. It doesn't, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.67,0:03:57.61,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,No?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.95,0:03:58.94,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Then sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.44,0:04:00.44,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:04.83,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What's going on?\NYou all seem distracted by something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.55,Main - Italics,_All,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.70,0:04:10.72,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, no! I overslept, and now I'm late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.72,0:04:13.23,Main - Italics,Yuki,0,0,0,,What class are we on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.31,0:04:16.43,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm sorry for being late!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.43,0:04:18.48,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,So you finally made it, Yoshikawa.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.25,0:04:31.85,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What gives, Yasuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.85,0:04:34.23,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You gotta stop! I can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.87,0:04:39.53,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I can't hold it back anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.53,0:04:42.01,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Lookin' cute today, Yasuda!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.28,0:04:45.14,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What's gotten into you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.14,0:04:46.59,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I look cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.59,0:04:48.67,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Have a look, Yasuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:53.24,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.24,0:04:54.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How did you not notice?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.99,0:04:56.88,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You can't fool us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.42,0:05:00.69,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Honestly...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.12,0:05:04.10,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,If they're going to do that, \NI want it done while I'm awake!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.10,0:05:07.32,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I want to be able to enjoy\N teenage girls playing with my hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.32,0:05:09.76,Main - Italics,Terajima,0,0,0,,There really is something \Nwrong with his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.76,0:05:12.26,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,That was a rare opportunity to...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.58,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.25\pos(137.455,72.909)\c&H575758&\3c&HEEEEEE&}Reference Room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.58,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.25\c&H575758&\3c&HEEEEEE&\pos(329.455,23.454)}Science Room
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.58,0:05:14.58,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.4\c&H575758&\3c&HE0DFE1&\pos(521.455,272.909)}Library
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.03,0:05:19.01,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Terajima-sensei, do you know \Nwhere the resource room key is?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.01,0:05:22.59,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I don't. Try asking the one\Nwho's in charge of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.59,0:05:25.84,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And who would that be?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.31,0:05:28.46,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Nakamine-sensei, I believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.02,0:05:32.57,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, I think \Nhe used the room yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.41,0:05:37.98,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Nakamine-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.30,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Please return the resource room key.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.94,0:05:48.04,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,I put it back yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.04,0:05:49.54,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It isn't there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.99,0:05:51.35,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,But I put it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.35,0:05:52.62,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It's not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.09,0:05:54.92,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,That's odd...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.97,0:05:57.08,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.08,0:06:00.05,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh, it was in my pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.47,0:06:02.04,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,My bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.04,0:06:05.34,Main - Italics,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why is {\i0}he{\i1} in charge of the key?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.34,0:06:08.10,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Man, I'm glad we found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.55,0:06:11.82,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You just dropped a different key.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.43,0:06:16.69,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,My bicycle key!\NI thought I lost it over the summer.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.69,0:06:18.18,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,O-Over the summer?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.18,0:06:19.94,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It's winter!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.38,0:06:22.03,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:24.32,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Now I can start riding my bike again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.60,0:06:27.19,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I didn't really do anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.52,0:06:29.73,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,No need to be humble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.73,0:06:33.70,Main - Italics,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Maybe we should entrust\Nthe key to someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.03,0:06:37.28,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Do you have any other keys on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.28,0:06:39.13,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:41.95,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey, it's Yasuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.95,0:06:43.84,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Who's that other teacher?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.84,0:06:45.56,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Nakamine-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.56,0:06:47.42,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Remember? The physics teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.39,0:06:53.64,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.14,0:06:56.11,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How does your pocket do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.11,0:06:57.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Was that a magic trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.42,0:06:58.91,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,That's a lot of keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.91,0:07:01.52,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.25,0:07:05.27,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I could do that too if I tried!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.64,0:07:08.21,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You don't need to get \Ncompetitive about it, Yasuda.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.78,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,No, I'm serious! I could totally do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.61,0:07:14.84,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sensei, there was another key over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.84,0:07:19.80,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh, thank you. I would've been\Nin trouble again without that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:21.66,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.14,0:07:28.19,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Th-The resource room key is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.19,0:07:30.57,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Nakamine-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.55,0:07:30.97,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(350,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\an8\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(321.364,88.968)}Loop
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.82,0:07:44.38,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.23,0:07:46.87,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,You dropped these.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.23,0:07:50.13,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh, silly me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.13,0:07:51.43,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.43,0:07:54.89,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sensei, you might have a hole in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.52,0:07:58.37,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,What? There's no way...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:08.25,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sensei, I have a sewing kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.82,0:08:10.18,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,You don't say!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.51,0:08:12.26,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\shad0\fay-.25\c&H404349&\3c&HADA9AF&\pos(304.728,125.272)\frx14\fry352\b1\frz359.3}Home Economics
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.84,0:08:16.76,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,You're quite skilled with \Nyour hands, young lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.76,0:08:20.32,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sensei, I'm Yoshikawa from class 3-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.32,0:08:22.65,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,R-Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.65,0:08:24.19,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:28.07,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,I don't teach class 3-1.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.72,0:08:32.07,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,But you taught us as first-years.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.54,0:08:34.26,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:40.26,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,I've had trouble remembering \Nfaces and names since I was young.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.58,0:08:45.07,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,But I remember you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.05,0:08:58.31,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It's an affair.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.08,0:09:01.15,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,But it's Nakamine-sensei...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.15,0:09:03.35,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,But it's {\i1}Nakamine-sensei{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.35,0:09:04.41,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,How'd he do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.41,0:09:07.42,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,How'd he get a teenage girl alone\Ndoing that for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.42,0:09:09.95,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Shut up. How should I know? Drop dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.95,0:09:11.99,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I don't like hearing\Nyou say that so casually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.99,0:09:14.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,This is no time to start\Nacting like a real teacher!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.22,0:09:21.12,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Gotta say, I never expected\N Yoshikawa to carry a sewing set.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:23.87,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I had no idea either. What's more...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.18,0:09:28.02,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,{fb}Toru, you're missing a button.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.02,0:09:30.14,Flashback,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{fb}Oh, I didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.14,0:09:33.14,Flashback,Yuki,0,0,0,,{fb}Honestly. Make sure you sew it back on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.10,0:09:38.61,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,That's how she treated me this summer!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:41.19,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Sounds like she has\Nno love for you whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.19,0:09:44.27,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You might as well be "Rando A" to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.27,0:09:49.02,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Don't talk like you know how she feels\Nwhen you don't, you sexual harasser!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.02,0:09:52.27,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Then what about Nakamine-sensei?\NWhat about him, huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.27,0:09:58.07,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Nakamine doesn't give off even a whiff of \Nulterior motives, criminality, or indecency.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.07,0:09:59.93,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You, on the other hand...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:03.51,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What?! I have only the purest intentions!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.51,0:10:04.55,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Huh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.55,0:10:05.40,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.91,0:10:11.50,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,You sewed it right up. Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.17,0:10:15.34,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Let me know if you ever get another hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.34,0:10:17.32,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,And take better care of those keys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.83,0:10:23.04,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Yoshikawa-san, do you always \Nhave a needle and thread on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.04,0:10:24.43,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure do.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.03,0:10:28.31,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,There's a certain someone \Nwho keeps losing his buttons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.82,0:10:31.82,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,But he doesn't tell me when it happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.82,0:10:34.37,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh, that's really too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.73,0:10:39.54,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Say, to show my appreciation, \Ncan I get you something to drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.54,0:10:42.49,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,No, thanks. I'm still working on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.23,0:10:45.49,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Hey, instead, Sensei, \Nlet me see your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.31,0:10:51.50,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What are they talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.84,0:10:53.25,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,How should I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.89,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,She finished mending...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.23,0:11:14.44,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Toru?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:15.43,Main,Nakamine,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.47,0:11:23.16,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What were you doing back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.06,0:11:26.44,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.78,0:11:28.10,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,With his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.10,0:11:29.29,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.29,0:11:30.87,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I was doing a palm reading.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.04,0:11:33.99,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What brought that on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.99,0:11:35.56,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm into it lately. It's neat.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.56,0:11:37.38,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I can read yours, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.38,0:11:38.86,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Nah, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.86,0:11:40.74,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,It's fine. I don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.02,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Your palm lines are so faint!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.02,0:11:53.95,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Just like Nakamine-sensei's!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.95,0:11:56.44,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's{\i0} what you were looking at?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.44,0:11:59.13,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Aren't you supposed to tell me how lucky I am?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.13,0:12:01.23,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I can't tell that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.23,0:12:03.65,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Go watch your horoscope on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.45,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Talk about a total cop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.31,0:12:09.58,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Listen, have you read anyone else's palms?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.89,0:12:11.09,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.09,0:12:14.20,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Oh, I did look at Hori's.\NHer lines were really easy to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.20,0:12:15.16,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Why do you ask?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.16,0:12:17.94,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I just don't want anyone\Nthinking you're a weirdo.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.35,0:12:20.92,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Not that I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.41,0:12:30.32,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Wait, are you saying you think I'm weird?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.32,0:12:31.48,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.48,0:12:34.77,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,I'm not a weirdo! I'm not!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.77,0:12:35.97,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:37.23,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Ishikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.66,0:12:40.73,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Miyamura says he's in for tomorrow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:43.99,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Nice! Where should we go, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.16,0:12:48.39,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What if we go find an empty classroom, bro?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.39,0:12:49.74,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Who are calling "bro"?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.74,0:12:51.83,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Ooh, what's this? Lemme in on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.46,0:12:56.25,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Just a little guy fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.65,0:12:57.65,Main,Yuki,0,0,0,,Sounds dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.65,0:12:58.19,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.36,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I had a hard time sneaking this in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.10,0:13:14.73,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Talk about huge...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.73,0:13:16.77,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,We all know bigger is better.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.77,0:13:24.65,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,3002)\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs20\b1\shad0\an8\c&H575758&\3c&HBEB9BC&1\pos(324,25)}Student Council
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.28,0:13:19.68,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I think looks are important, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.68,0:13:23.08,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,No way. Size is where the romance lies.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.42,0:13:27.86,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hello, young adolescent boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.86,0:13:31.84,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What do we have here\Nthat's got you all so... excited...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.09,0:13:36.54,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Where do you live, Yasuda?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.06,0:13:39.67,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why? Are you going to come\Nburn my place down?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.67,0:13:41.58,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,No, I'm just interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.58,0:13:44.92,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You don't need to be interested \Nin where your teachers live.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.92,0:13:50.93,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.35\c&H505053&\3c&HDDE0E4&\b1\move(328.122,0,328.122,82.787)}Student Counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.44,0:13:47.75,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,And besides, you three are in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.75,0:13:49.00,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Do you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.00,0:13:50.93,Main,_All,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.31,0:13:56.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,But school policy doesn't \Nforbid having cake in a classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.13,0:13:59.19,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,A whole cake is just too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:03.02,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Come to think of it, you live \Npretty close to school, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.02,0:14:05.84,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I remember sending you a New Year's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.45,0:14:09.53,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Are you planning to visit?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.53,0:14:13.20,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You'd better not! And we're \Nstill talking about the cake!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.95,0:14:16.10,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,We don't care about the cake anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.10,0:14:18.24,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,We want to know how you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.24,0:14:19.96,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You're a little {\i1}too{\i0} honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.28,0:14:22.32,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Do you live by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.32,0:14:25.21,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Huh? Well, you could say that...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.53,0:14:26.76,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Got a girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.76,0:14:27.74,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.74,0:14:30.20,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Why does that matter anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.20,0:14:31.81,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Because, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.81,0:14:34.74,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You always go around saying how \Nmuch you like high school girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:37.86,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,If you had a perfectly normal, \Nuninteresting girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:40.23,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\frz9.359\pos(176.8,49.2)\c&H6E68C0&}Perfectly normal girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.81,0:14:40.23,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\an8\b1\shad0\frz9.359\c&H444855&\3c&HEAEEF4&\pos(101.486,239.715)}Yasuda's perfectly \Nnormal girlfriend (pending)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.86,0:14:38.97,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I'd be disappointed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.97,0:14:40.23,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,"Uninteresting"?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.23,0:14:42.00,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Ah, yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.49,0:14:45.17,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,If he had a girlfriend, \Nthat alone would be a shock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:45.92,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.92,0:14:48.74,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I said I don't, so you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:54.53,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,Yasuda, let me know if you ever get a\Nperfectly normal and uninteresting girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:56.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\frz9.359\pos(176.8,49.2)\c&H6E68C0&}Perfectly normal girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:56.87,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\an8\b1\shad0\frz9.359\c&H444855&\3c&HEAEEF4&\pos(166.629,159.714)}Yasuda's perfectly \Nnormal girlfriend (pending)\NHas no hobbies
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.87,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,What exactly are you going for here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.33,0:14:59.31,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Don't you want to get married?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.31,0:15:01.50,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I don't have anyone {\i1}to{\i0} marry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.50,0:15:02.63,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Weren't you listening?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.16,0:15:04.58,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,You should do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.93,0:15:07.84,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Marry your super-normal,\Ncompletely uninteresting girlfriend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:10.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnArial\fs12\b1\shad0\frz9.359\pos(176.8,49.2)\c&H6E68C0&}Perfectly normal girlfriend
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.21,0:15:10.13,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnComic Sans MS\fs16\an8\b1\shad0\frz9.359\c&H444855&\3c&HEAEEF4&\pos(88.342,115.028)}Yasuda's perfectly \Nnormal girlfriend (pending)\NHas no hobbies\NHer friends are all getting\N married recently
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.84,0:15:10.13,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Seriously, who the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:14.55,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I mean, I just don't want Nakamine-sensei \Nto get married before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.55,0:15:16.91,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,He's really fixated on Nakamine.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.23,0:15:21.17,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Damn it, I'm fraternizing with students!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.17,0:15:24.01,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I'd love to see where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.01,0:15:25.08,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.08,0:15:26.65,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You jerks aren't welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.09,0:15:30.00,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,However, if you bring some girls, \NI'll allow you in!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.00,0:15:32.70,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Miyamura, you bring Hori! \NIshikawa, you bring Yoshikawa!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.70,0:15:35.16,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Iura, you bring Ayasaki and Kono!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.53,0:15:36.71,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.71,0:15:38.08,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Then forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.08,0:15:43.67,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened to your enthusiasm?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.08,0:15:43.67,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(690,1)\fnComic Sans MS\an8\b1\shad0\c&H263131&\3c&HEAEEF4&\pos(134.4,18)}I wanna see where you live!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.01,0:15:45.51,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,You're the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.51,0:15:47.80,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,I'm not sending you \Na New Year's card next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.80,0:15:49.05,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I wasn't expecting one.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.49,0:15:51.90,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're thinking,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.90,0:15:55.20,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,but those two don't have any \Nstrong feelings toward me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.20,0:15:56.67,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Oh, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.67,0:15:57.81,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.81,0:16:01.10,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Now, back to the cake...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.31,0:16:07.59,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.59,0:16:08.72,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Go back to class.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.72,0:16:10.94,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Oh, can we? Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.94,0:16:12.95,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.35\c&H505053&\3c&HDDE0E4&\b1\pos(301.722,93.187)}Student Counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.39,0:16:15.51,Main,Iura,0,0,0,,Yasuda, we'll come visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:19.19,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Sure, just bring me some cake, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.19,0:16:20.95,Main - Italics,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,What a terrible teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.95,0:16:24.23,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Sensei, we'll come back \Nfor the cake after school,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.23,0:16:26.46,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,so be sure to keep it cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.46,0:16:28.54,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.66,0:16:38.91,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Just what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.97,0:16:41.47,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(500.419,263.586)}Science Prep Room
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.15,0:17:05.38,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's nine o'clock\Nin the student council room.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.20,0:17:10.00,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The door's locked...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.69,0:17:13.67,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,and there's a slumbering demon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.41,0:17:17.94,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,How could she fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.26,0:17:19.76,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Is it drugs?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:21.80,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Is she taking drugs?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.76,0:17:22.77,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fad(520,1)\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs20\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(102.019,157.186)}It's because\Nthe room's so warm
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.41,0:17:28.52,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, I'll let the demon sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.52,0:17:32.28,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,If I call the school, it should \Nring in the faculty office.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.28,0:17:34.28,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnArial\shad0\fs16\frz334.9\pos(348.8,146)\3c&HECEFEC&\c&H292A25&}Please Charge
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.87,0:17:36.29,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.90,0:17:39.52,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Whoa, it's dark.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.52,0:17:41.99,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What's going on? What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.99,0:17:43.41,Main - Italics,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.39,0:17:45.44,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It seems...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.44,0:17:51.07,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,someone locked the door \Nwhile we were sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.42,0:17:54.36,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,How could you let that happen, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.36,0:17:56.56,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Y-You didn't wake up either, Kyo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.56,0:17:58.43,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Don't put all the blame on me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.43,0:18:01.94,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Aw, man! I was going to \Nbuy carrots on the way home!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.43,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:08.22,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The gardening club's growing \Na bunch. Just take those.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.22,0:18:10.33,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What kind of council president are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.81,0:18:13.28,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Kyo-chan, your phone! Call someone!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.28,0:18:15.44,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,The school! Anyone! Just do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:22.58,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1)\an6\fnImpact\i1\fs36\c&H0A0A03&\shad0\blur1\3c&H8A8B7F&\pos(506.571,167.429)}R\NU\NM\NB\NL\NE
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:19.78,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Is that how you ask someone to do something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.78,0:18:21.33,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,No, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.33,0:18:22.83,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,But please hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.83,0:18:24.75,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Okay, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.75,0:18:26.77,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Sengoku, what's the school's phone number?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.83,0:18:31.57,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,You should have that stored!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.57,0:18:32.84,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Can it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.84,0:18:35.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,We just need to check the student handbook.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.18,0:18:38.34,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Right! Now hurry up and call! Make it snappy!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.34,0:18:40.72,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Why are you in such a rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.72,0:18:43.00,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,You don't need to use the restroom, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.00,0:18:44.18,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Don't copy me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.18,0:18:45.47,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's perfectly natural!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.47,0:18:47.10,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Wait, you have to go, too?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.26,0:18:51.54,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Honestly, what the hell are you two doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.54,0:18:53.73,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I was just going home—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.60,0:18:56.64,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hey, where are you going?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.64,0:18:58.03,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Where's my thank you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.03,0:18:59.86,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(440,1)\an7\fnArial\b1\shad0\fs36\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(190.819,96.386)}Restroom
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.86,0:19:02.37,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.35\c&H16110C&\3c&H695951&\b1\pos(299.322,93.987)}Student Counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.74,0:19:05.37,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,So, what were you doing here so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.37,0:19:07.25,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,He fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:10.27,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Hang on. Hori-san was asleep, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:12.57,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.57,0:19:15.97,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You weren't up to something \Ninappropriate, were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.97,0:19:17.03,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.03,0:19:18.76,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.76,0:19:25.51,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,It happens. Students stay\Nlate and start making out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.51,0:19:28.89,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hold it! Don't accuse us of that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.89,0:19:34.40,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,And isn't this the fault of whoever locked\N the door without checking inside first?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.40,0:19:35.75,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hmm? What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.75,0:19:37.44,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,I can't hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.49,0:19:42.49,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Well, there are ways \Nto figure out what you were up to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.11,0:19:46.02,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hori, take off your clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.02,0:19:49.17,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,What's going on here, Yasuda-sensei?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.77,0:19:52.22,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Terajima-sensei, you're just in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.22,0:19:54.92,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,You check Sengoku.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.92,0:19:56.71,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,It would be the other way around.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.71,0:19:58.92,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,And I'm not checking anyone. \NThis is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.92,0:20:01.85,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Checking their lower bodies\Nwill tell us everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.85,0:20:04.14,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,We won't be doing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.14,0:20:06.85,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I certainly hope you haven't used that excuse
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.85,0:20:09.68,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,to do anything inappropriate \Nto female students.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:14.60,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,You two may go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.60,0:20:17.80,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,I need to speak with this perv of a teacher.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.80,0:20:19.19,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:22.46,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Terajima-sensei, calling me \Na perv is going too far!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.19,0:20:28.95,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes NEw Roman\fs18\shad0\fay-.35\c&H16110C&\3c&H695951&\b1\pos(299.322,93.987)}Student Counseling
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.00,0:20:24.83,Main,_Both,0,0,0,,If you'll excuse us...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.83,0:20:25.96,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Wait, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.96,0:20:28.95,Main,Terajima,0,0,0,,Now, we're going to go over this in detail.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.85,0:20:31.35,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I need to hurry home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.90,0:20:33.85,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,It's so cold in the hallway.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:42.72,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh? You got locked in, Hori-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.21,0:20:44.30,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.38,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You could have just called me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.38,0:20:48.98,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,No need. We got out pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.48,0:20:50.51,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Were you alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.51,0:20:51.58,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Weren't you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.58,0:20:54.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I wasn't alone. Sengoku was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.40,0:21:02.26,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,President, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.26,0:21:04.29,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,You were stuck in a room \Nwith Hori-san, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.29,0:21:06.20,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Did she doing anything to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.20,0:21:08.30,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,I'm fine. Safe and sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.30,0:21:09.32,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.57,0:21:13.37,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,What do you mean by that?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.69,0:21:16.50,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,I-I mean, just considering\Nthe power dynamic...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:17.13,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Right?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.13,0:21:19.38,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,Leave me out of this, Miyamura-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.38,0:21:21.53,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,I'd like to hear {\i1}exactly{\i0} what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.53,0:21:24.28,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,This is what he's talking about, Kyo-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.51,0:21:27.01,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.17,0:21:32.07,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Hori-san, you mustn't resort to violence.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.57,0:21:38.54,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Consider anger a chance to improve yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.54,0:21:40.64,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,and purge it from your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.74,0:21:45.74,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,That was Yasuda, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.74,0:21:47.78,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,It certainly looked like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.24,0:21:53.42,Main,Ishikawa,0,0,0,,It sounds like he got a talking-to from \NTerajima-sensei and had a change of heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.81,0:21:57.26,Main,Sengoku,0,0,0,,That was more than a change of heart!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.26,0:21:59.25,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,More like he's been brainwashed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.65,0:22:01.93,Main,Hori,0,0,0,,Terajima-sensei is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.93,0:22:02.66,Main,Miyamura,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.77,0:22:05.89,Main,Yasuda,0,0,0,,Life is precious.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.09,0:22:09.97,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(520,1)\fnArial\b1\an7\shad0\c&H1D1F1E&\3c&HE9F0EE&\pos(170.819,53.986)}He was back to normal\Nthe next day
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.47,0:23:40.18,Main,_Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(487,1)\c&HC2A774&\3c&HF4F9ED&\shad0\an7\fs16\pos(452.242,317.744)}Next time\Npage.10 Jealousy
